---
title: Progressive Learning (Augment Roster Entry)
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant WP as WP Plugin
    participant API as FastAPI /roster/{id}/augment
    participant RS as RosterService
    participant VAL as DataValidationPort
    participant STORE as RosterStoragePort (PostgreSQL)
    participant HYBRID as HybridIndexManager

    WP->>API: POST augment payload (embedding, observationId)
    API->>RS: add_augmented_embedding(...)
    RS->>VAL: validate_embedding(vector, model)
    VAL-->>RS: []
    RS->>STORE: save_roster_entry(updated entry)
    STORE-->>RS: success
    RS-->>API: True (appended)
    API->>HYBRID: background reload request (debounced)
    HYBRID->>STORE: load_roster_entries()
    HYBRID->>HYBRID: rebuild FAISS index (weighted aggregates)
    API-->>WP: 200 OK + updated entry snapshot
